## Adapted material

### Bead Me Up, Scotty (MIT)
Copyright (c) 2026 Brendan
https://github.com/brendan-appstart/bead-me-up-scotty
Version v0.4.0, commit cf6dda198db15a77399d1d9e77292618a7d08fa1

Domain definitions and blocking semantics were adapted (not copied
verbatim) in:

- src/lib/status.ts: status set and display order
- src/lib/dependencies.ts: blocking dependency types
- src/lib/writes/guard.ts: blockingDeps and the status guard
- src/lib/view/ready.ts: the Ready predicate

Scotty itself documents these against the bd data model; the implementations
here are rewritten for this codebase.

### Circle (MIT)
Copyright (c) 2025 lndev-ui | Circle Template
https://github.com/ln-dev7/circle
Commit b0ba7ddcc3d0f4c16092236ca6a01b56c0614810

Visual and structural reference for the shell, list, detail, board and
